# Benchmark output: holds live access tokens for every prepared account, and an
# untracked results/ directory would make collect.ps1 record gitDirty: true for
# every run it just produced.
load-tests/benchmark/results/

# 飽和式壓測輸出：tokens.json 裡是真實帳號的 bearer token，加上每次執行的摘要，
# 同樣理由——沒忽略的話 run-saturation.ps1 每次執行後都會讓工作目錄變 dirty，
# 而且 git add -A 會不小心把活的 token 收進版控歷史。
load-tests/k8s/results/

# Kubernetes runtime secrets and generated TLS material
k8s/runtime/
